cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use ToxTempAssistant in your work, please cite the article listed
  under preferred-citation.
title: ToxTempAssistant
type: software
abstract: >-
  LLM-based web application that helps toxicologists draft ToxTemp
  descriptions of cell-based toxicological test methods (OECD Guidance
  Document 211) from their own documents, for expert review and export.
authors:
